  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "GSearch: add a sortFields parameter to gfindObjects.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Robert Waltz: \"I am curious as to the best manner to include lucene sorting in the lucene implementation of gsearch.\"",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "...",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "\"I have a requirement to allow the user to select from a list of fields to sort by. So, I will need to pass the field to sort by via the query string in a REST call.\"",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "There is one statement in fgslucene.Statement.java that should be modified for sorting, namely",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Hits hits = searcher.search(query);",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "where an additional Sort parameter may be given. ",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "The solutions seems to be to add a sortFields parameter to gfindObjects.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
